@{b}Protracker Music Generator@{ub} – v6.7

This manual describes every feature of the PyQt6 GUI (v6.7). It explains each tab, each control, and common workflows.

Note: AmigaGuide files are plain text. On Windows/Linux you can read them in any editor; on an Amiga (or emulator) open them in AmigaGuide/MultiView.

Quick links:
- @{"Quick Start" LINK QUICKSTART}
- @{"GUI Overview" LINK GUI}
- @{"Options" LINK OPTIONS}
- @{"Troubleshooting" LINK TROUBLE}
